@startuml
actor Patient
participant "Frontend (React)" as FE
participant "Backend (Express)" as BE
participant "Database (MongoDB)" as DB
participant "Email Service" as Email

== Register & Verify ==
Patient -> FE: Fill registration form
FE -> BE: POST /api/auth/register
BE -> DB: Create User (hashed password)
DB --> BE: Success
BE -> Email: Send verification code
Email --> Patient: Receives code
Patient -> FE: Enter code
FE -> BE: POST /api/auth/verify
BE -> DB: Mark user as verified
DB --> BE: Success
BE --> FE: Verification result

== Login ==
Patient -> FE: Fill login form
FE -> BE: POST /api/auth/login
BE -> DB: Find user by email
DB --> BE: User data
BE: Compare password
BE: Sign JWT
BE --> FE: Login result + token
FE --> Patient: Redirect to dashboard

== Access Protected Route ==
Patient -> FE: Access dashboard
FE -> BE: GET /api/auth/me (with JWT)
BE: Verify JWT
BE -> DB: Get user by ID
DB --> BE: User data
BE --> FE: User profile
FE --> Patient: Show dashboard
@enduml
